---
title: Migration · journal and separate cleanup
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> preview
    preview --> apply : Prepare [snapshot]
    apply --> apply : Publish / Record
    apply --> idle : Crash / Finish
    idle --> apply : Resume [unfinished]
    idle --> idle : SuccessfulRun / DamageBackup
    idle --> cleanup : RequestCleanup [proof]
    cleanup --> idle : RemoveLegacy [safe]
    idle --> rolled_back : Rollback [snapshot]
    rolled_back --> apply : Prepare
    note right of apply
        INV legacy retained
        Receipts follow publication
    end note
    note right of cleanup
        INV intact snapshot
        INV no live targets
        Fresh delivery required
    end note
    classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef idle stroke-dasharray:4 3
    class apply live
    class cleanup wait
    class preview,rolled_back idle
